@startuml agentic-service
title Agentic Service , ES:CONCEPT:agentic-service
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class "Service\n<<universal, foundational>>" as svc
class "Agentic Service\n<<contextual specialization>>\nv1.3.0" as asvc

svc <|-- asvc : specializes

note right of svc
  Universal ; means through which
  a capability or value is made available
  per ADR-ES-002
end note

note right of asvc
  Contextual specialization
  per ADR-ES-014
  Material agentic behavior required
end note

note bottom of asvc
  Orthogonal to Autonomous Service
  per ADR-ES-014 §11
end note
@enduml
